Backport Quickstart runtime safety from kenzok8/small-package
commit d4611b99118531f49f26a834e5ee6400e201c15a.

Apply to a build copy after loading managed compat/istore_backend.lua.
Keep the local temperature/status adapter. Explicitly load nixio.util and
reject short readall EOF, malformed framing and oversized chunk headers.
Package validation uses the same ASCII alphabet in Lua and shell.

